OL,3,ASouth Korea demands apology from
OL,4,APyongyang for landmine blasts that
OL,5,Ainjured three
OL,6,
OL,7,FSouth Korea's military has demanded an
OL,8,Fapology from North Korea for landmine
OL,9,Fblasts along their shared border that
OL,10,Fwounded South Korean soldiers earlier
OL,11,Fthis month.
OL,13,FThree South Korean personnel were
OL,14,Finjured by explosions in the
OL,15,FDemilitarised Zone (DMZ) - a buffer
OL,16,Fzone separating the two Koreas, on 21
OL,17,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
