OL,3,ASouth Korea demands apology from
OL,4,APyongyang for landmine blasts that
OL,5,Ainjured three
OL,6,
OL,7,FSouth Korea said on Tuesday it was
OL,8,F"certain" that the blasts, which
OL,9,Fhappened on South Korea's side of the
OL,10,FDMZ, came from North Korean mines. It
OL,11,Fvowed to take "corresponding measures"
OL,12,Ffor what he said was a violation of a
OL,13,Fdecades-old armistice.
OL,15,FNorth Korea has denied responsibility
OL,16,Ffor the blasts, calling Seoul's claims
OL,17,F"groundless" and a "farce" to escalate
OL,18,Ftensions on the peninsula.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
